{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51302","headline":"三月三日寒食从刘八丈使君登迁仁楼眺望 · 李穆","name":"三月三日寒食从刘八丈使君登迁仁楼眺望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"从公无小大，在伴乐人贤。\n楚国逢荒岁，随人若有年。\n空波交水埒，重岫夹畲田。\n桑柘温风软，云霞返照鲜。\n因高寺刹迥，临远郡楼偏。\n花柳清明节，亲宾上巳筵。\n故乡徒有路，春雁独归边。\n幸望山阴客，爲文内史前。\n（《刘长卿集》五）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李穆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51302.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51302","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}